{"id":"torrey:gifts-of-god-the","source":"torrey","name":"Gifts Of God, The","slug":"gifts-of-god-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"All blessings are — Jas 1:17; 2Pe 1:3.","refs":[["Jas",1,17,1,17],["2Pet",1,3,1,3]]},{"text":"Are dispensed according to his will — Ec 2:26; Da 2:21; Ro 12:6; 1Co 7:7.","refs":[["Eccl",2,26,2,26],["Dan",2,21,2,21],["Rom",12,6,12,6],["1Cor",7,7,7,7]]},{"text":"Are free and abundant — Nu 14:8; Ro 8:32.","refs":[["Num",14,8,14,8],["Rom",8,32,8,32]]},{"text":"Christ the chief of. — Isa 42:6; 55:4; Joh 3:16; 4:10; 6:32,33.","refs":[["Isa",42,6,42,6],["Isa",55,4,55,4],["John",3,16,3,16],["John",4,10,4,10],["John",6,32,6,32],["John",6,33,6,33]]},{"text":"Are through Christ. — Ps 68:18; Eph 4:7,8; Joh 6:27.","refs":[["Ps",68,18,68,18],["Eph",4,7,4,7],["Eph",4,8,4,8],["John",6,27,6,27]]},{"text":"The Holy Spirit. — Lu 11:13; Ac 8:20.","refs":[["Luke",11,13,11,13],["Acts",8,20,8,20]]},{"text":"Grace. — Ps 84:11; Jas 4:6.","refs":[["Ps",84,11,84,11],["Jas",4,6,4,6]]},{"text":"Wisdom. — Pr 2:6; Jas 1:5.","refs":[["Prov",2,6,2,6],["Jas",1,5,1,5]]},{"text":"Repentance. — Ac 11:18.","refs":[["Acts",11,18,11,18]]},{"text":"Faith. — Eph 2:8; Php 1:29.","refs":[["Eph",2,8,2,8],["Phil",1,29,1,29]]},{"text":"Righteousness. — Ro 5:16,17.","refs":[["Rom",5,16,5,16],["Rom",5,17,5,17]]},{"text":"Strength and power. — Ps 68:35.","refs":[["Ps",68,35,68,35]]},{"text":"A new heart. — Eze 11:19.","refs":[["Ezek",11,19,11,19]]},{"text":"Peace. — Ps 29:11.","refs":[["Ps",29,11,29,11]]},{"text":"Rest. — Mt 11:28; 2Th 1:7.","refs":[["Matt",11,28,11,28],["2Thess",1,7,1,7]]},{"text":"Glory. — Ps 84:11; Joh 17:22.","refs":[["Ps",84,11,84,11],["John",17,22,17,22]]},{"text":"Eternal life. — Ro 6:23.","refs":[["Rom",6,23,6,23]]},{"text":"Not repented of by him. — Ro 11:29.","refs":[["Rom",11,29,11,29]]},{"text":"To be used for mutual profit. — 1Pe 4:10.","refs":[["1Pet",4,10,4,10]]},{"text":"Pray for. — Mt 7:7,11; Joh 16:23,24.","refs":[["Matt",7,7,7,7],["Matt",7,11,7,11],["John",16,23,16,23],["John",16,24,16,24]]},{"text":"Acknowledge — Ps 4:7; 21:2.","refs":[["Ps",4,7,4,7],["Ps",21,2,21,2]]},{"text":"Life. — Isa 42:5.","refs":[["Isa",42,5,42,5]]},{"text":"Food and raiment. — Mt 6:25-33.","refs":[["Matt",6,25,6,33]]},{"text":"Rain and fruitful seasons. — Ge 27:28; Le 26:4,5; Isa 30:23.","refs":[["Gen",27,28,27,28],["Lev",26,4,26,4],["Lev",26,5,26,5],["Isa",30,23,30,23]]},{"text":"Wisdom. — 2Ch 1:12.","refs":[["2Chr",1,12,1,12]]},{"text":"Peace. — Le 26:6; 1Ch 22:9.","refs":[["Lev",26,6,26,6],["1Chr",22,9,22,9]]},{"text":"All good things. — Ps 34:10; 1Ti 6:17.","refs":[["Ps",34,10,34,10],["1Tim",6,17,6,17]]},{"text":"To be used and enjoyed. — Ec 3:13; 5:19,20; 1Ti 4:4,5.","refs":[["Eccl",3,13,3,13],["Eccl",5,19,5,19],["Eccl",5,20,5,20],["1Tim",4,4,4,4],["1Tim",4,5,4,5]]},{"text":"Should cause us to remember God. — De 8:18.","refs":[["Deut",8,18,8,18]]},{"text":"All creatures partake of. — Ps 136:25; 145:15,16.","refs":[["Ps",136,25,136,25],["Ps",145,15,145,15],["Ps",145,16,145,16]]},{"text":"Pray for. — Zec 10:1; Mt 6:11.","refs":[["Zech",10,1,10,1],["Matt",6,11,6,11]]},{"text":"Illustrated — Mt 25:15-30.","refs":[["Matt",25,15,25,30]]}],"refCount":68}
